<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντάφιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of, belonging
			to</i> or <i>used in burial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.67
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντάφιον, τό,</span>
			<i>shroud, winding-sheet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.125
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δὲ τοιοῦτον οὔτ᾽ εὐρὼς οὔτε . .
					ἀμαυρώσει χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					4.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὸν ἐ. ἡ τυραννίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					6.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλλιστον ἐ. ἕξουσι τὸν ὑπὲρ τῆς
					πατρίδος θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.10.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πλοῦτος δ᾽ οὐκἐμὸν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.294
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ ἐντάφια καταλιπόντι</span>”
				<i>money for funeral expenses,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			: later in sg., <i>funeral expenses,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				5.1708.205
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <i>offerings
				to the dead, obsequies,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				326
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				8.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				313.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>): Cyren. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντόφιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Notiz.Arch.</u>
					4.96
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
